{title: 152 A ti, Jesús}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{lyricist: Laurie Klein (1950-; Vers. esp.: Leni A. Uría de Zamorano (1947-}
{composer: Laurie Klein (1950- )}

{sov}
[F] [Gm] [F]
A ti, Jesús, alzaré mi voz,
[Bb] [F] [Gm] [F] [Fsus4] [Dm] [C]
para ado rar te, mi Sal -va dor.
[F] [Gm] [F]
Acepta hoy, mi Rey y Señor,
[F7] [Bb] [F] [Gm] [C] [Bb] [F]
el humilde don de mi amor en oración.
{eov}
